{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {

    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お互いのiPhoneでWi-Fiをオンにしておいてください。同じWi-Fiにつながっていなくても登録できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on Wi-Fi on both iPhones. You don't need to be on the same Wi-Fi network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これからは、あなたとパートナーの家事を分担し、協力していくことができます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now you and your partner can share the chores and work together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "しばらくお待ちください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please wait a moment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "または" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "or"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度、デバイスを近づけてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please bring your devices close together and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デバイスの名前を確認してください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the device names"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "リンクで招待" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Invite with a Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "他のメンバーが登録を開始するのを待っています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waiting for the other member to start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共に家事を頑張るパートナーへ、エールを送り合いませんか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Why not cheer each other on as you share the chores?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同居人の登録" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add Housemates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同居人同士でこの画面を開いて近づけてください。自動的に登録が始まります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open this screen on each other's iPhones and hold them close together. Registration will start automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接続エラー" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connection Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録が完了しました！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registration complete!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録に失敗しました" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registration failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録はもうすぐ完了します！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Almost done!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録を終了すると、また初めから登録し直す必要があります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you stop now, you'll need to start over from the beginning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録を開始して、あなたを待っています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Started and waiting for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録を開始する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start Registration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録処理を終了しますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop registration?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手のアプリのアップデートが必要です" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The other device needs an app update"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の端末でアプリを最新バージョンにアップデートしてから、もう一度お試しください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Update the app to the latest version on the other device, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終了する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示されているメンバーで登録を開始しますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start registration with the members shown?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通信中のメンバーがキャンセルしました" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The other member canceled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通信状態をご確認のうえ、もう一度つなぎ直してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please check your connection and try connecting again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "離れている相手には、招待リンクを送って参加してもらえます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If they're not nearby, send them an invite link to join."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.1"
